If $n$ is odd, the required sum is
$$
\begin{aligned}
& 1^2+2.2^2+3^2+2.4^2+\ldots . .+2(n-1)^2+n^2 \\
& =\frac{(n-1)(n-1+1)^2}{2}+n^2 \quad(\because n-1 \text { is even }) \\
